# Sprite logins

One `##` heading per site. Copy a block to add more.
Never commit `logins.md`. Never put these values in an iMessage.

## First site
- url: https://example.com/login
- username: you@example.com
- password: replace-me
- notes:

## Second site
- url: https://other.example.com/login
- username: you@example.com
